      "label": "Religious Peace Blessing Ritual",
      "description": "The act of a priest performing a blessing, often associated with peace or reconciliation, is a common liturgical practice in Christian traditions, particularly in Catholicism. The gesture of placing a hand on the forehead is symbolic of imparting grace or blessing. Understanding this ritual requires knowledge of Christian liturgy and its symbolic meanings.",
