      "instance_name": "mugshot",
      "label": "Mugshot",
      "description": "A mugshot is a photograph taken by law enforcement of a person who has been arrested or is in custody. It is used for identification and record-keeping purposes. The use of a mugshot in a meme implies criminality or association with the justice system, which is a key element in the meme's message.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
