      "instance_name": "criminality_association",
      "label": "Criminality Association Stereotype",
      "description": "The meme uses the mugshot to imply that the person associated with the religious figure (or the institution) is linked to criminal behavior. This is a harmful stereotype that equates religious figures or institutions with violence or crime, which is not necessarily true and can be offensive to religious communities.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
