      "description": "The meme implies that religious institutions or individuals associated with peace can also be linked to violence or criminality. This is a harmful stereotype that can contribute to negative perceptions of religious figures or institutions, and it is based on the assumption that peace and war are mutually exclusive, which is not always the case.",
