      "description": "The priest's facial expression is serious and focused, conveying a sense of reverence and solemnity appropriate for a religious blessing ritual. His eyes are directed downward toward the person being blessed, and his mouth is closed in a neutral, composed manner, reflecting the gravity of the sacramental act.",
